OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 FEB
OL,4,G1900FTony Blackburn's Golden Hour
OL,5,     GTony Blackburn spins his personal
OL,6,     Gpick of the hits from across the
OL,7,     Gdecades. To listen on most smart
OL,8,     Gspeakers just 'ask BBC Sounds to
OL,9,     Gplay Tony Blackburn's Golden
OL,10,     GHour'.
OL,11,G2000FThe Paul Gambaccini Collection
OL,12,     GGambo has Grammy Record of the
OL,13,     GYear Winners & Brits Who Topped
OL,14,     GThe US Charts. Also, his Ivor
OL,15,     GNovello winner is Michael Ball.
OL,16,     GAnd a live track from Neil Young.
OL,17,G2200FRadio 2 Unwinds with Angela
OL,18,     FGriffin
OL,19,     GPiano Chill with Angela Griffin,
OL,20,     Gfeaturing new music by Lucy Rose
OL,21,     Gand a Kickback Track from JP
OL,22,     GCooper.
